        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK = primary key, FK = foreign key (same database), &lt;i&gt;ref&lt;/i&gt; = bare ID of another table/service (no foreign key)&lt;br&gt;Solid line with crow&#39;s foot = foreign key. Dashed red line = logical reference, no FK, no cross-database read.&lt;br&gt;&quot;Foods&quot; is the Ingredient entity of the design.&lt;br&gt;Recommendation, Notification (gRPC) and NotificationWorker are stateless: no database." vertex="1">
